<title>BULGARIA: Bulgarian August unemployment steady at 10.4 pct.</title>
<headline>Bulgarian August unemployment steady at 10.4 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SOFIA 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The number of people unemployed in Bulgaria in August was steady at 396,155 or 10.4 percent of the workforce against 396,381 in July, the National Labour Exchange (NLE) said.</p>
<p> BULGARIAN UNEMPLOYMENT  AUGUST	JULY     AUGUST 95</p>
<p> monthly total	     396,155    396,381    406,959</p>
<p> pct of workforce	   10.4	 10.4	 10.7</p>
<p>&quot;The jobless rate was practically unchanged as new university graduates continued to register on the labour market but more labour vacancies in farming and construction industry were filled,&quot; NLE chairman Milcho Dimitrov told reporters.</p>
</text>
